  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lao Elephant Mobile Unit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to establish a mobile elephant unit in Laos to address critical conservation challenges facing the Asian elephant population, mitigate human-elephant conflicts (HEC), and promote ethical and sustainable tourism practices. Proposed activities include providing modern veterinary care, vaccination, reproduction advice, and emergency response services to elephant camps and owners across Laos, alongside supporting wild elephant conservation programs through in-field data collection, analysis, and HEC mitigation efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
